  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "50ac24ec-8225-4537-9602-b752cb8a8a92",
      "name": "Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -140,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## W1 - Website lead intake\nForm (Vercel /api/lead route) -> POST /webhook/website-lead -> Grist **Leads** + **Run_Log**.\n\n**After importing, set up once:**\n1. Credentials (Credentials > Create, type *Header Auth*):\n   - **Lead webhook secret**: Name `X-Lead-Secret`, Value = a long random string (same value goes in Vercel as N8N_LEAD_SECRET).\n   - **Grist API**: Name `Authorization`, Value = `Bearer <your Grist API key>`.\n   Then open the *Webhook* node and every blue *Grist* (HTTP Request) node and pick them.\n2. Edit the **Config** node: registry_doc_id = the doc id of your *Agency Registry* Grist doc.\n3. Test with the *Test URL*, then **Activate** the workflow (the Production URL only works when active).\n\nThe staff alert is a STUB: it builds the message but sends nothing yet.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 620
      }
    },
